{"code":"002210","name":"동성제약","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 1957년 설립, 1990년 유가증권시장 상장된 중견기업으로 충남 아산에 생산공장, 중앙연구소, 서울 의약외품연구소, 대구 암센터 등 전국 13개 사업장을 운영하고 있음. 의약품, 염모제, 화장품 등 3개 사업부문을 영위하고 있음. 광면역 암치료제, 인지기능 개선 건강기능식품 등 다수 특허 기술 보유하고, 메디컬·기능성 화장품 개발로 고부가가치 제품 확대를 추진하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-11-27","n_days":300,"close":1019.0,"open":936.0,"high":1026.0,"low":936.0,"volume":36847,"amount":36469346.0,"ret_1d":3.9796,"gap":-4.4898,"range_pct":8.8322,"ret_5":2.002,"ret_20":-14.7993,"ret_60":-31.7482,"ret_120":4.7276,"ret_250":4.7276,"ma20":1056.8,"ma60":1230.4,"ma120":1217.1167,"ma200":1119.47,"close_vs_ma200":-8.9748,"close_vs_ma60":-17.1814,"ma_align":0,"ma50":1189.28,"ma150":1168.2933,"ma200_chg_21":0.8554,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-80.5469,"r2_60":0.9058,"slope_120":33.0257,"r2_120":0.0422,"slope_250":40.2785,"r2_250":0.3375,"high52":2525.0,"low52":908.0,"pos_52w":6.8646,"dd_52w":-59.6436,"from_low52":12.2247,"mdd_1y":-47.9415,"atr14_pct":4.9418,"vol_ann_60":37.6617,"stop_atr2_pct":9.8836,"vol_avg20":54955.6,"vol_ratio20":0.6705,"vr5":0.7301,"vr20":0.4341,"amount_avg5":49327533.2,"amount_avg20":58546186.15,"amount_avg60":83438071.75,"obv_chg20":-55.7967,"turnover_20":1.1376,"pv_eff_20":-13.0096,"rsi14":37.9567,"frgn_net_5":46036.0,"inst_net_5":-838.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0476,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0009,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0468,"frgn_net_20":64578.0,"inst_net_20":248.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0668,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0003,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0671,"frgn_net_60":47115.0,"inst_net_60":1153.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0488,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0012,"smart_net_60_pct":0.05,"frgn_net_120":-64217.0,"inst_net_120":-2382.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.0665,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0025,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.0689,"foreign_ratio":0.95,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.08,"smart_buy_streak":5,"op_income_q":-17.0,"op_margin_q":-8.5859,"op_qoq":15.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-525.0,"rev_yoy":-9.1743,"op_trend_4q":50.090